1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:06,200
Riya Sharma... the case against you was filed by you.

2
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:49,290
Where am I... what is this place?

3
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:57,580
Riya Sharma... the case against you was filed by you.

4
00:01:00,792 --> 00:01:06,092
You... you are me?

5
00:01:09,792 --> 00:01:13,830
You only ever listen to yourself, Riya.

6
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:17,502
I didn't say anything wrong.

7
00:01:20,268 --> 00:01:22,565
I only told you the truth...

8
00:01:22,615 --> 00:01:25,688
but you took it as an attack.

9
00:01:30,267 --> 00:01:31,837
You never listen, Riya.

10
00:01:31,887 --> 00:01:37,107
And you never understand me either.

11
00:01:39,692 --> 00:01:42,022
You humiliated me in front of everyone!

12
00:01:42,072 --> 00:01:46,422
I only wanted to stop you.

13
00:01:48,705 --> 00:01:51,833
Have you eaten, beta?

14
00:01:51,883 --> 00:01:56,355
The same question every time, Maa.

15
00:02:00,832 --> 00:02:03,332
You don't care about me at all.

16
00:02:17,042 --> 00:02:19,261
Three witnesses will come.

17
00:02:19,311 --> 00:02:25,362
I don't need anyone. I am right.

18
00:02:37,042 --> 00:02:38,622
Do you have the courage to hear the truth, Riya?

19
00:02:38,672 --> 00:02:40,172
Yes...

20
00:02:43,342 --> 00:02:45,912
In your story, I can never be right...

21
00:02:45,962 --> 00:02:50,142
because it has only one character.

22
00:02:53,182 --> 00:02:54,970
An apology?

23
00:02:55,020 --> 00:02:59,302
It was his fault.

24
00:03:03,992 --> 00:03:05,792
You won't be able to live alone.

25
00:03:11,942 --> 00:03:14,302
Everyone thinks I'm the one who's wrong.

26
00:03:18,542 --> 00:03:21,461
They never trusted me.

27
00:03:21,511 --> 00:03:24,442
They never understood me.

28
00:03:37,007 --> 00:03:39,717
You never listened. You only answered.

29
00:03:39,767 --> 00:03:46,547
I did listen... I felt no one was listening to me.

30
00:03:46,717 --> 00:03:49,133
At least talk to me.

31
00:03:49,183 --> 00:03:53,087
There's no point anymore.

32
00:03:57,067 --> 00:03:58,567
Okay, beta...

33
00:04:08,167 --> 00:04:10,467
How will I live alone...

34
00:04:16,747 --> 00:04:18,387
Now it's Maa's turn.

35
00:04:24,167 --> 00:04:28,947
You never understood me. You only asked if I'd eaten.

36
00:04:32,747 --> 00:04:32,953
An apology to Maa?

37
00:04:33,003 --> 00:04:34,503
Why should I?! Why does it always happen to me?!

38
00:05:08,887 --> 00:05:11,327
Now hear the truth.

39
00:05:12,967 --> 00:05:17,487
The truth is... you weren't wrong. You were tired.

40
00:05:22,668 --> 00:05:28,648
You hurt Maa... but not on purpose.

41
00:05:42,375 --> 00:05:46,235
Maa... please forgive me...

42
00:05:59,113 --> 00:06:01,273
I understand, Riya.

43
00:06:09,683 --> 00:06:11,243
I'm with you.

44
00:06:14,958 --> 00:06:16,528
The verdict is...

45
00:06:16,578 --> 00:06:19,478
Forgive yourself.

46
00:06:36,458 --> 00:06:38,278
Maa, have you eaten?

47
00:06:44,900 --> 00:06:48,780
I have, beta... have you?

48
00:07:34,830 --> 00:07:39,720
The story hasn't ended... it has just begun.

